- A Claude Code provider (shown without "Other agents"): the person's own,
  unmodified claude, signed in by them; Meridian never touches its sign-in.
  Every tool off (--tools "", dontAsk, no settings/hooks/MCP/slash
  commands, nothing stored), so it needs no sandbox and runs on Windows too.
  A key or a parent Claude session in the environment isn't passed on.
  Signed out: "Run claude in Terminal to sign in".
- The updater checks every 20 minutes instead of hourly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
